      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>O Pokémon Comedor de Sonhos. No fim da noite, Munna aparece ao lado dos travesseiros das pessoas. Enquanto se alimenta de sonhos, os padrões em seu corpo brilham suavemente. A névoa que libera é rosa quando o sonho é bom e preta quando se trata de um pesadelo.</p><p><strong>SR:</strong> 2 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Nível Mínimo Encontrado:</strong> 1 &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Grupo de Ovos:</strong> Campo &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Gênero:</strong> 50% M / 50% F &nbsp;•&nbsp; <strong>Estágio Evolutivo:</strong> 1/2</p><p><strong>Evolução:</strong> Munna pode evoluir para Musharna no nível 14 ou superior, com a ajuda de uma Moon Stone. Quando evolui, seus pontos de vida aumentam no dobro do seu nível.</p><h3>Moves por Nível</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Nível</th><th>Moves adquiridos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:center'>1</td><td>Defense Curl, Psywave</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>2</td><td>Lucky Chant</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>3</td><td>Yawn</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>4</td><td>Psybeam</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>5</td><td>Imprison</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>6</td><td>Moonlight</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>7</td><td>Hypnosis, Magic Coat</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>8</td><td>Zen Headbutt</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>9</td><td>Synchronoise</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>10</td><td>Nightmare</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>11</td><td>Future Sight</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>12</td><td>Calm Mind</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>13</td><td>Psychic</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>14</td><td>Dream Eater, Moonblast</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>15</td><td>Stored Power, Telekinesis</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:center'>16</td><td>Wonder Room T M s : A ft e r Y o u, A l ly S w i tc h, A t t ra c t, C al m M in d, C h a rg e B e a m, C o n f id e, Da zz li n g G l e a m, D o u b le T e a m, D r e a m Ea te r, E n e rg y B a ll, E x p a n d in g Force, Facade, Frustration, Gravity, Guard Swap, Gyro Ball, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Imprison, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Pain Split, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Swagger, Swift, Telekinesis, Thunder Wave, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Wonder Room, Worry Seed, Zen Headbutt Egg Moves: Barrier, Baton Pass, Curse, Healing Wish, Helping Hand, Magic Coat, Secret Power, Sleep Talk, Sonic Boom, Swift Defesas de Tipo: ½ ½ x2 x2 x2</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>TMs</h3><p>After You, Ally Switch, Attract, Calm Mind, Charge Beam, Confide, Dazzling Gleam, Double Team, Dream Eater, Energy Ball, Expanding Force, Facade, Frustration, Gravity, Guard Swap, Gyro Ball, Heal Bell, Helping Hand, Hidden Power, Imprison, Light Screen, Magic Coat, Pain Split, Power Swap, Protect, Psych Up, Psychic, Psyshock, Rain Dance, Reflect, Rest, Return, Rock Slide, Rock Tomb, Round, Safeguard, Shadow Ball, Shock Wave, Signal Beam, Skill Swap, Sleep Talk, Snore, Substitute, Swagger, Swift, Telekinesis, Thunder Wave, Torment, Toxic, Trick, Trick Room, Wonder Room, Worry Seed, Zen Headbutt</p><h3>Egg Moves</h3><p>Barrier, Baton Pass, Curse, Healing Wish, Helping Hand, Magic Coat, Secret Power, Sleep Talk, Sonic Boom, Swift</p>",
